{"id": "utt_00167", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00167_story_003.wav", "duration": 6.0, "text": "बँईया मजे कोय अच्छरंग दिखाँ जब पानी में डालते ही गोल जाए आल्ग", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 6.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1032}
{"id": "utt_00168", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00168_story_003.wav", "duration": 5.0, "text": "अदा तेही राँ जाए औरे पिंटू भीए, आजी शहर से हर्याल तोता रंगल है", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 5.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.128}
{"id": "utt_00169", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00169_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "अग बार लग ड़ायत पूरा रँंग तुछ तुछ", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.116}
{"id": "utt_00170", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00170_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "अबी ये रंग सामने से फेख़।", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.124}
{"id": "utt_00172", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00172_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "आप बाबु, इक नाला है, जिस पर रंक फ़े कि लिए ग़ा", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1329}
{"id": "utt_00173", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00173_story_003.wav", "duration": 4.0, "text": "अली पर्सू है, आज खुव लिए तो कपडे कितर है रग दिया", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 4.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.0993}
{"id": "utt_00174", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00174_story_003.wav", "duration": 4.0, "text": "उरग साधन यक यही आद किशा उठ़़र काहति अद", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 4.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1121}
{"id": "utt_00175", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00175_story_003.wav", "duration": 4.0, "text": "इप पिंट्वा ही मुख्या जिके मुपर कालिग पोतने पुट्वा", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 4.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.0919}
{"id": "utt_00176", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00176_story_003.wav", "duration": 4.0, "text": "तश्वम तम्रु दर्किई पिंट वाख कुद डान्द मिलेगा", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 4.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1203}
{"id": "utt_00177", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00177_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "वुगरो बाढाजी, यसे दिन कोई हमें मारकर चला गया, तो सचा चा अगर था।", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "angry", "intensity": 0.75, "rms_energy": 0.1274}
{"id": "utt_00178", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00178_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "बा-वा हुल ु बा-वाु �儲 ँ और इस路 घा लिए गाग लितढरान बते है चरन ।थिस क्ि और को लिए मफली इसक ख ।ज्न रहिं各位 लूँख लोग आัश या कि उक जिन ज्न वम. रहिं �", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1404}
{"id": "utt_00179", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00179_story_003.wav", "duration": 4.0, "text": "भर मुखाला करा आए जादा आमे परशान पत करो आमकुई रास नहीर अज़ा", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 4.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1295}
{"id": "utt_00181", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00181_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "अद्राँगो का त्यावार है, मुख्या जी एसा कैसे कर सकते हैं?", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1254}
{"id": "utt_00182", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00182_story_003.wav", "duration": 5.0, "text": "क्या करु मेरी जान, जो भी वा कलती से हौए, म।क्याची के चैरे से रंक भी उतरने का नाम नहीं लेगे।", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 5.0, "emotion": "surprise", "intensity": 0.75, "rms_energy": 0.1182}
{"id": "utt_00183", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00183_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "मैंने तो रंगाव में बेषने से मना कर दिया है तुकान दारव।", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.1163}
{"id": "utt_00184", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00184_story_003.wav", "duration": 3.0, "text": "तो कमल भी तो हमारे प्यार की निशानी है ना मेरी जान?", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 3.0, "emotion": "angry", "intensity": 0.75, "rms_energy": 0.1103}
{"id": "utt_00187", "story_id": "story_003", "audio_path": "data_storage/segments/utt_00187_story_003.wav", "duration": 4.0, "text": "और कहां से लेए आए ये बदबू बाभाजी", "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 4.0, "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.5, "rms_energy": 0.123}
